OL,5,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe B&Bers head off to the great
OL,7,     Foutdoors at Eden Valley Glamping
OL,8,     Fsite in Armathwaite, Cumbria,
OL,9,     Fwhere hosts Liz and Dave hope to
OL,10,     Fconvert their guests with their
OL,11,     Fback-to-basics approach.
OL,12,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FNeil and Mary welcome their rivals
OL,14,     Fto Fernie Castle in Fife. There's
OL,15,     Fplenty of traditional Scots
OL,16,     Fsplendour on show, but two guests
OL,17,     Faren't impressed by the
OL,18,     Fcontinental breakfast.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/12
