OL,5,G1030 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe last visit of the week is to
OL,7,     Fthe Cadillac Kustomz Hotel on the
OL,8,     FIsle of Bute, where owners Brody
OL,9,     Fand Rima hope to rock their
OL,10,     Fguests' worlds with a music-filled
OL,11,     Fretro retreat.
OL,12,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FOn payment day, there are curtain
OL,14,     Fcomplaints and breakfast blues as
OL,15,     Fthe B&Bers iron out their issues,
OL,16,     Fbefore they find out how much
OL,17,     Fthey've been paid and who's won
OL,18,     Fthe week.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG2/12
