OL,5,G1135 Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FBirmingham. Hair and beauty tutor
OL,7,     FApril Richards plans a very
OL,8,     Fadventurous menu featuring zebra
OL,9,     Fmeat and squid ink pasta. But one
OL,10,     Fof her guests is a staunch
OL,11,     Fvegetarian... (Ep1/5)
OL,12,G1205 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FBirmingham. Scientist John Fennel
OL,14,     Fexperiments with soda-siphoned
OL,15,     Ffish batter and an unusual method
OL,16,     Ffor making ice-cream. (Ep2/5)
