OL,5,G1235 Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FBirmingham. Self-professed
OL,7,     F'brilliant cook' Vanessa Erigbogbo
OL,8,     Fplans a refined night of dining,
OL,9,     Ffeaturing lobster, confit of
OL,10,     Fduck... and fried grasshoppers.
OL,11,     F(Ep3/5)
OL,12,G1305 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FBirmingham. Paz Thakrar hopes to
OL,14,     Fimpress his meat-eating guests
OL,15,     Fwith a vegetarian menu and a spot
OL,16,     Fof karaoke. (Ep4/5)
OL,17,G1340 Come Dine with Me
OL,18,     FBirmingham. Toni Shukla is the
OL,19,     Ffinal host of the week. There's
OL,20,     Fjust one problem: she doesn't know
OL,21,     Fhow to cook... (Ep5/5)
