OL,5,G1415 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FDavid and Giles take a modern
OL,7,     Fapproach to running their B&B,
OL,8,     FLangland Road, in the Mumbles,
OL,9,     Fnear Swansea. But not all of their
OL,10,     Fguests can work out the high-tech
OL,11,     Fofferings.
OL,12,G1450 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FMargaret runs the Castle Lodge
OL,14,     FHotel in Felixstowe to exacting
OL,15,     Fstandards, but not all of the
OL,16,     Fguests are pleased with the decor
OL,17,     Fand there's some horsing around
OL,18,     Fduring the group outing.
