OL,5,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FGordon and Sandra host at Bryn
OL,7,     FWoodlands House in Colwyn Bay,
OL,8,     Fwhere they take their guests
OL,9,     Fharness racing. But how will one
OL,10,     Fguest react to finding a snake in
OL,11,     Fhis bed?
OL,12,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FEdward and Rachel offer some
OL,14,     Fshowbiz razzmatazz at The
OL,15,     FTollemache Arms in Cheshire. But
OL,16,     Fthe show's nearly over at
OL,17,     Fbreakfast when Ed ruins the eggs
OL,18,     Fand sets fire to a towel.
