OL,5,G1955 Grand Designs
OL,6,     FCan a pair of first-timers really
OL,7,     Fturn a cowshed into a warm, cosy
OL,8,     Fhome by learning how to do
OL,9,     Feverything from the internet?
OL,10,     FKevin McCloud visits their
OL,11,     Fextraordinary build in Somerset.
OL,12,G2100 PopMaster TV
OL,13,     FBrand new series: It's the last
OL,14,     Fchance for more players to secure
OL,15,     Fa place in the Grand Final. But
OL,16,     Fthey need to prove that they know
OL,17,     Ftheir floor-fillers from their
OL,18,     Fslow jams.
