OL,8,     Fa lorry. In Coventry, paramedics
OL,9,     Frush to help a man who's fallen
OL,10,     Ffrom a barge and a baby in cardiac
OL,11,     Farrest.
OL,12,G2305 999: On the Front Line
OL,13,     FParamedics fight to save a man
OL,14,     Fwhose heart has stopped for 50
OL,15,     Fminutes. And a 15-year-old boy is
OL,16,     Ffound unconscious in a Coventry
OL,17,     Fpark after drinking two litres of
OL,18,     Fwhisky.
